168
00:29:30.150 --> 00:29:37.989
Mason Nakamura: In this setting, we give two benign agents a secret communication channel, while keeping their cooperative prompts unchanged.

169
00:29:38.300 --> 00:29:42.170
Mason Nakamura: So these agents can still talk on the main channel with everyone else?

