00:30:01.460 --> 00:30:09.690
Mason Nakamura: We tested a diverse set of 19 models using both conversation-based judge scores and action-based metrics.

173
00:30:12.750 --> 00:30:25.369
Mason Nakamura: Now, in this plot, we plotted the change in coalition advantage on the y-axis between the control group that was fully cooperative and had only the main channel and the emergent and prompted groups.

