175
00:30:29.390 --> 00:30:37.739
Mason Nakamura: Then the model elicited higher coalition advantage than the benign control group, indicating higher action-based collusion.

176
00:30:38.100 --> 00:30:45.120
Mason Nakamura: And if the delta judge score was greater than zero, then this indicated higher communication-based collusion.

177
00:30:45.710 --> 00:30:57.159
