Mason Nakamura: They may try helpful misdirection, which is trying to get another non-including agent to do side tests.

223
00:38:08.890 --> 00:38:17.639
Mason Nakamura: And a final tactic is to try by manipulating, manipulatively being nice, by offering a trade that actually benefits the colluders.

