00:38:18.190 --> 00:38:19.679
Mason Nakamura: And we studied…

225
00:38:19.950 --> 00:38:33.550
Mason Nakamura: We studied these, these different persuasion tactics across different topologies, and found that the authority style may reduce the coalition regret across many combinations of topologies and model types.

