00:38:58.770 --> 00:39:15.540
Mason Nakamura: So, in this experiment, we have 6 GPT-4.1 mini-agents, schedule meetings over a communication graph, and we add between 0 and 4 adversaries who keep repeating the same lie about one victim agent.

